From 10651fd3dbb0c90640a1f10b5c317ea90824ceb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 12:37:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Passport header: approved identity design (rebuilt on
 current tree)

Re-applies the approved header design, adapted around the availability
chip already in this tree (chipState API kept as-is):
- Owner: full-width Edit Profile button at the bottom of the card
- Trust Score pill always visible for owner ('Not yet rated' when null)
- Display name mixed case; avatar vertically centered
- Saved pill removed (Saved stays reachable in the owner menu)
- Stats row restyled as a bordered ticket card; onStatsLoaded reports
  stats up (no duplicate fetch)
- World Traveler faded stamp at 5+ countries (owner: passport stats;
  public passports: distinct postcard countries)
- Passport tab label Plans -> Trips (key/order/persistence unchanged)
Mirrored to artifacts/travel-buddy
